{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"The Devil Arrives in Sasazuka\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-04\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"When the lord of demons and his horde waged war against the humans in their realm, a hero vanquished their army. Cornered, the Devil fled through an interdimensional portal to Earth. He vows to one day reign again, but until then... he needs a job!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267441/4516068.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"魔王, 笹塚に立つ\"},{\"title\":\"The Hero Stays at the Devil`s Castle for Work Reasons\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-11\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"When Emilia the hero finally tracks down the ruler of demons here on Earth, he's not exactly what she was expecting. Which may or may not make her a little crazy.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267441/4523076.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"勇者, 仕事優先で魔王城に泊まる\"},{\"title\":\"The Devil Goes on a Date with His Junior in Shinjuku\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-18\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Something supernatural seems to be going on with Chiho. Meanwhile, it's possible Maou doesn't really understand the concept of a \\\"date\\\"... but it's not long before everyone has much bigger problems on their hands.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267441/4523077.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"魔王, 新宿で後輩とデートする\"},{\"title\":\"The Hero Experiences Human Warmth\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-25\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"In the aftermath of the cave-in, Emi sees a side of Maou that doesn't jibe with the demonic king she knew in Ente Isla. Meanwhile, everyone sees a side of the landlady that nobody could have expected...\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267441/4523078.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"勇者, 心の温かさに触れる\"},{\"title\":\"The Devil and the Hero Save Sasazuka\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-02\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Lucifer is wrecking the neighborhood in a big way, and he's brought along some unexpected friends! To save both themselves and their new Earthly home, can Emi, Maou, and Ashiya do the impossible and... work together?!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267441/4523079.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"魔王と勇者, 笹塚を救う\"},{\"title\":\"The Devil Climbs the Stairway to School\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-09\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Back in Ente Isla, the other high priests find out about Olba's betrayal. Meanwhile, Lucifer's moved into the Devil's Castle and gotten Maou and Ashiya into school ghost stories.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267441/4523080.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"魔王, 学校の階段を昇る\"},{\"title\":\"The Devil`s Budget Is Saved by Neighborliness\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-16\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Maou and company find that a young lady named Suzuno has moved in next door. She is quick to make friends and starts helping them out, which causes Emi to wonder what her motives are.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267441/4523081.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"魔王, 近所付き合いで家計を助けられる\"},{\"title\":\"The Hero Enters the Fray\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-23\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Emi and Suzuno have some truly epic miscommunications, but when they finally get those straightened out, they're even less on the same page than before. Meanwhile, Maou's got bigger (?) problems: there's a new fast-food restaurant in town!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267441/4523082.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"勇者, 修羅場に突入する\"},{\"title\":\"The Hero Experiences a Fray\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-30\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Insisting that Emi and Suzuno need an impartial third party to resolve their dispute, Rika goes with them to meet Maou. Meanwhile, Maou tries to handle the loss of business caused by the opening of a new restaurant.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267441/4523083.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"勇者, 修羅場を経験する\"},{\"title\":\"The Devil and the Hero Take a Break from the Daily Routine\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2013-06-06\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"It's a busy day at the local amusement park, with crowded restaurants, animals on the loose, scary ghosts, and a much-needed swimwear intervention.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267441/4523084.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"魔王と勇者, いつもと違った日常を過ごす\"},{\"title\":\"The Hero Stays True to Her Convictions\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2013-06-13\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"The stranger Suzuno met at the train station has her reconsidering her position on the Devil. Emi, however, is unwavering.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267441/4523085.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"勇者, 己の信念を貫く\"},{\"title\":\"The Devil Carries Out His Duties\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"2013-06-20\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"The archangel Sariel is willing to torture people to get what he wants, and he's confident that no one can stop him--but he didn't realize quite how seriously Maou takes his responsibilities.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267441/4523086.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"魔王, 己の職責を果たす\"},{\"title\":\"The Devil and the Hero Do Some Honest Hard Work\",\"number\":13,\"airDate\":\"2013-06-27\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Ashiya has something he needs to talk to his master about in private. Are the demons going back to Ente Isla?!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267441/4587075.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"魔王と勇者, 真っ当に仕事に励む\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":3600,"tags":[]}